			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S[alutem] d[ico] p[lurimam].</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Binas iam a te literas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Nicht erhalten.</note> accepi, pater colendissime, neque a me tibi <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>responsum est hactenus, idque quia vel defuit nuncius<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">Nach <hi>der Abkürzung für</hi> - us <hi>in</hi> nuncius <hi>gestrichenes</hi> s.</note> vel copia scribendi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z3"/>In primis quae de rebus bellum attinentibus<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Über den Krieg zwischen <persName ref="p18538">Karl V.</persName> und <persName ref="p20225">Franz I.</persName></note> ad me<pb type="edition" next="489"/> respondisti, non tam me <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>quam alios quoque cordatos salutique nostrę consultum volentes fratres magnis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>affecerunt gaudiis.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Est autem <placeName ref="l760">Solidurnensis</placeName> quidam exul<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Unbekannt. Es handelt sich dabei um einen <placeName ref="l832">Franzosen</placeName> (s. unten Z. 13).</note> apud nos, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vir praedives, qui rumoribus eiusmodi imprimis favet; is et hunc<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="4">das Gerücht.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>praecipue sparserat inter nostros.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Hoc ego ignorans acceptas literas <persName ref="p2919">Michae<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>li</persName><note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p2919">Michael Schlatter</persName>.</note>, <persName ref="p7147">Iacobo</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p7147">Jakob Würben</persName>, seit 1528 Verweser und seit 1529 Pfarrer und Seelsorger an der Leutkirche in <placeName ref="l49">Biel</placeName>; s. J[acob] <hi>Wyß,</hi> Das <placeName ref="l49">Bieler</placeName> Schulwesen, <placeName ref="l49">Biel</placeName> 1919, S. 18.</note> et aliis in viri istius praesentia clare perlego.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">His per<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>lectis uni familiari meo<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Einem unbekannten Vertrauten oder Hausangestellten von <persName ref="p8082">Frey</persName>.</note> propter eundem rumorem verbis, quantum queo, <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>insulto.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ibi Soloduranus ille, sparsi mendacii apud nos author, in<lb xml:id="p1z11"/>clinato capite confusus ac tacitus a nobis se paulatim submovit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Tum is, cui insultaram: „Dei (inquit) providentia hoc sic <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>evenit; cessabit iste posthac regi suo huiusmodi seminare <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nugas“ etc.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Sic ego volens ac sciens benevolis sinum lętitia opplevi<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b">vi <hi>in</hi> opplevi <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>malevolis inscius et casu moerorem confusionemque tuis literis attuli.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Gratia deo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Una cum secundis literis mihi libellum De spe <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>christianorum<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Ende August 1544 erschienene <hi>Schrift</hi> "Hoffnung der Glöubigen"; s. oben <ref target="file12000">Nr. 1953</ref>, Anm. 9.</note> e Commentariis<note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Matthäus-Kommentar; s. oben <ref target="file12000">Nr. 1953</ref>, Anm. 7.</note> tuis versum mittis, pro quo tibi ma<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ximas merito gratias habeo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Recepi vero post <persName ref="p2919">Michaelis</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10"><persName ref="p2919">Michael Schlatter</persName>.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>nostri tum<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c">tum <hi>könnte auch als</hi> tam <hi>gelesen werden.</hi></note> non expectatam ad vos profectionem.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Dicunt et cęteri, <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>quibus libellos a te missos divisi, habituros se tibi summas semper <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>gratias, quin etiam ii omnes et valent et te salutatum literis meis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>volunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Novi equidem habeo nihil, nisi novum sit tibi, quod <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>nostri vicini<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> oder <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>? Falls <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName>, s. unten <ref target="file12072">Nr. 2025</ref>.</note> faciunt.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutabis ergo tuos omnes nomine meo et <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>me, ut facis, diliges<note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12">me diliges: Cicero, Epistulae ad familiares, 9, 22, 4.</note>.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l49">Biellnis</placeName>, 5. calen[das] nov[embris] <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>anno 1544.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Totus ex animo tuus <persName ref="p8082">Ioannes Leo<lb xml:id="p1z27"/>poldus Fry</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Eruditissimo simul atque piissimo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> ecclesię antistiti <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>patri suo summo semper observando.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l587">Zür<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
